            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "iampriceless"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was a bit bland and I only used 1/2 cup of flour but the rest was the same. I’d add more cayenne next time and maybe parsley. I also used it on fresh pickerel caught in the summer and frozen until now. Great recipe and perfectly cooked.",
            "datePublished": "2025-04-21T22:52:16.967Z"
