            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Susan Emma"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fabulous, and THE only way to eat Perch! I even used gluten free flour. If making more than one \"batch\", you may need to use additional butter. I may try a combo of butter and oil next time. LOVE the video, Chef John!",
            "datePublished": "2018-05-19T21:23:42.887Z"
